     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The anatomy of a solution proposal at B2.2",
     "texto": [
      "A formal proposal document articulates four pragmatic pillars: formulation of the objective through sentences with **um … zu**, instrumental measures with **indem** or action nouns (**durch den Ausbau**), a clear allocation of responsibilities and costs, and assessment of the expected impact (**nachhaltige Entlastung herbeiführen**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
